{{!--
  about.hbs — markdown layout for the Rust half of THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

  Rendered by `cargo about generate` (see about.toml) and spliced into the
  final file by scripts/licenses/notices.mjs. cargo-about groups by unique
  licence TEXT, not by licence id: MIT carries a per-copyright-holder notice,
  so the same id legitimately appears many times with different bodies.
  Reproducing each one is the whole obligation.

  Block-comment form (`{{!-- --}}`), not the short one: the short form ends at
  the first `}}` it sees, so a comment that mentions handlebars syntax spills
  its own tail into the rendered output.

  TRIPLE braces everywhere, deliberately. Handlebars HTML-escapes the double
  form, which turns the quotes in `BSD 3-Clause "New" or "Revised" License`
  into `&quot;` and would corrupt any licence body containing & < > " — i.e.
  it would publish an altered copy of the very text we are obliged to
  reproduce verbatim. This is a markdown file, not HTML; nothing here wants
  escaping.

  Four-backtick fences, so a licence body containing a normal ``` fence (or
  indented code) still round-trips.

  No summary table here: notices.mjs builds it from the bullets below, after
  filtering out this workspace's own crates. cargo-about's `overview` counts
  them in, so a table rendered here would disagree with its own list.
--}}
